WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.016 --> 00:00:01.016
- [Announcer:] And blocked by Turner.

00:00:01.529 --> 00:00:02.711
That’s his fourth.

00:00:05.797 --> 00:00:06.464
- I do my job.

00:00:07.933 --> 00:00:10.969
My job’s to go out there and block shots, cause havoc defensively on the floor. 

00:00:11.458 --> 00:00:12.721
Lay it all out there on the line for my team.

00:00:13.051 --> 00:00:13.513
Make plays.

00:00:17.374 --> 00:00:19.144
For this season, we have a great team,

00:00:19.144 --> 00:00:21.563
and I think we’re gonna make a serious playoff run this year.

00:00:22.144 --> 00:00:23.398
You have to have your own mindset,

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:24.274
your own philosophies.

00:00:25.057 --> 00:00:27.652
Go back to your training. Remember what got you here.

00:00:27.652 --> 00:00:28.737
It doesn’t matter who we play.

00:00:32.016 --> 00:00:34.200
Life in the NBA comes with chatter.

00:00:34.356 --> 00:00:35.076
Can’t let it rattle you.

00:00:36.147 --> 00:00:37.704
If you let your opponent determine

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:39.164
the way you view a game or, like, 

00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:40.790
your outlook on the game, then that’s an issue.

00:00:44.633 --> 00:00:45.712
My future, it’s untapped.

00:00:46.994 --> 00:00:48.173
I came to work on myself

00:00:48.784 --> 00:00:50.425
and better myself day in and day out.

00:00:54.316 --> 00:00:56.556
I watch a lotta film cuz it’s able to show you

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:59.142
every little aspect of one individual play.

00:00:59.974 --> 00:01:01.811
I think that’s something that’s gonna really allow me

00:01:01.811 --> 00:01:03.396
just to get better and better each and every year.

00:01:07.557 --> 00:01:09.152
I came in the league at 19 years old.

00:01:09.874 --> 00:01:11.029
This is my fifth year now, 

00:01:11.029 --> 00:01:13.740
and I haven’t been able to break that first-round ice yet, so,

00:01:14.150 --> 00:01:15.150
my expectations are high.

00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:18.536
You know, the anchor for, you know, one of the best defensive teams in the league,

00:01:18.940 --> 00:01:22.957
I wanna just keep elevating, seek new heights and just make a deep playoff run.

00:01:22.957 --> 00:01:23.957
Man, I think we’re really capable.

